msgid ""
"**Description**: Get GWAS credible sets (fine-mapped loci) associated "
"with a genetic variant from Open Targets. Returns studies where this "
"variant appears in a fine-mapped credible set, with locus-to-gene (L2G) "
"predictions, p-values, effect sizes, and the fine-mapping method used. "
"Essential for understanding which GWAS signals a variant is part of and "
"which genes it likely affects."
msgstr ""

